  "body": "The sentences are in:\n- 4.10.15 The fieldset element\n- 4.10.19.5 Enabling and disabling form controls: the disabled attribute\n- 6.8.6 Writing suggestions\n\nIn each case:\n\n- The form is roughly `X is a thing whose Y is foo and is bar`, where it's ambiguous where the `is bar` attaches: does it modify X or Y?\n\n- The ambiguity is resolved in the status quo by higher-level knowledge that one of the interpretations doesn't make sense.\n\n- Instead, disambiguate grammatically by repeating the subject before the problematic \"is\".\n\nFor discussion in Matrix, see https://matrixlogs.bakkot.com/WHATWG/2026-06-12#L6 and following\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/12651/form-control-infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 6, 2026, 9:28 PM UTC (493271b)\">/form-control-infrastructure.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/12651/e5749bd...493271b/form-control-infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 6, 2026, 9:28 PM UTC (493271b)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/12651/form-elements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 6, 2026, 9:28 PM UTC (493271b)\">/form-elements.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/12651/e5749bd...493271b/form-elements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 6, 2026, 9:28 PM UTC (493271b)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/12651/interaction.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 6, 2026, 9:28 PM UTC (493271b)\">/interaction.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/12651/e5749bd...493271b/interaction.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jul 